data: {"id": "6f687c99f093408a-thinking-parallel_evidence-128", "run_id": "6f687c99f093408a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，根据已有计划和 ReAct 预采集结果，先执行 K8s 描述、YAML 和 Topology 工具，再结合已有结果进行补证。\n\n1. `kubectl_describe`：确认 Pending 原因及事件\n2. `kubectl_get_yaml`：提取调度约束\n3. `query_pod_topology`：获取控制器/节点关系\n4. 补证：日志查询失败（ES Forbidden），改用 `kubectl_logs` 直接读 Pod 日志\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788403523343, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

