data: {"id": "6f687c99f093408a-thinking-parallel_evidence-665", "run_id": "6f687c99f093408a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集证据与因果分析\n\n### 支持候选原因（PendingUnschedulable）的事实\n1. **Pod 状态为 Pending，未绑定节点**：`node: <none>`，`nodeName: None`，`kube_pod_status_phase=1 (Pending)`。\n2. **调度器拒绝事件**：`Warning FailedScheduling` 原文：`\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"`。\n3. **PodScheduled 条件为 False**：`reason=Unschedulable`，message 同上。\n4. **调度约束**：YAML 中 `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`。这个 label 语义上表示\"不可用\"，因此集群中所有 3 个节点均不匹配该选择器，导致 0/3 节点可调度。\n5. **Topology 确认控制器链**：Pod → Repli", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788403532756, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

