data: {"id": "6f687c99f093408a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1547", "run_id": "6f687c99f093408a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 状态（直接证据）\n- **Pod 状态：Pending**，未分配到任何节点（`node: <none>`）\n- **事件**：`Warning FailedScheduling 72s` — **\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"**\n- **Node Selector**：`aiops.lab/unavailable=true` — **该选择器要求节点标签 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`**，但集群中所有节点均不满足此条件\n- **Tolerations**：`node.kubernetes.io/not-ready:NoExecute`（300s）\n- **Container**：`app`，镜像 `python:3-alpine`，运行 `sleep 3600`\n- **日志**：无输出（Pod 未调度，容器未启动）\n\n### 2. Topology\n- Pod `workl", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788403551301, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

